    "notes": "User product decision: glass_shelf is 87.3 × 28.5 × 0.6 cm (6 mm) and material=cam. Canonical glass_shelf owns those product properties and recipes switch only its identity from legacy partId to itemKey while preserving ×2/×3 quantities. createShowcaseModule consumes canonical dimensions and resolves material=cam through the shared normal glass appearance. Normal glass uses GLASS_APPEARANCE; table glass uses explicit TABLE_GLASS_APPEARANCE physical-render overrides; panel backing remains a panel-only renderer effect; projector lens remains specialized and is not changed. Existing parent showcase state, placement, move, rotation, snap/collision/connection, selection, context menu, persistence and reflow semantics are unchanged. Renderer still creates eyeCount-1 internal divider meshes; BOM quantities remain recipe-owned and are not inferred from renderer mesh count. Change Gate domains required by production/BOM/scene3d/theme changes are declared for review; findings are review declarations only and no audit remediation is included."
  },
